'''Shield Drain Damage''' is a hidden, unique damage type which has neutral damage modifiers against all enemy [[shield]] types. This damage type applies damage to [[shield]]s and [[overguard]]. It is applied only by certain Warframe abilities.

==Mechanics==
*Does not bypass [[Damage Reduction|damage reduction]].

==Status Effects ==
Shield Drain Damage does not possess any applicable status procs on its own.

